{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1253101-say-the-scarlet-empress-had-a-child-with","id":1253101,"title":"Say the Scarlet Empress had a child with...","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-09-10T10:33:40-07:00","id":1253101,"title":"Say the Scarlet Empress had a child with...","content":"Okay say the Scarlet Empress isn\u2019t an Akums but she did end up Marrying the Ebon Dragon, or possibly Malfeas or Ligier. What would be the best way to handle her child, say that was part of the wedding help you start up the Sword of Creation Contract.<br /> <br /> One straight forward way is the child is a human or Dragonblooded that could be interesting and would definitely Merit a new House.<br /> <br /> Other ideas are like the Elemental Dragons and the Child is a Behemoth or Baby Primordial esque being. Not digging making the baby a 3rd circle soul, that seems more appropriate for two Primordial marrying and sharing a soul, but this case it would be weird to give birth to your husbands soul. But a 3rd circle level god/demon that wasn\u2019t linked to the soul could work.<br /> <br /> But either way a New House would be cool. And I\u2019m assuming the Empress could return much richer now that she shares some Hell Wealth, maybe making her new Child Regent.<br /> <br /> <br /> How do you think the Realm would react to her returning with a mystery child, maybe one that is a literal Dragon? She could even go the route that the child was immaculately conceived by the Dragons. But her return under these conditions most likely may kick off her disconnect with the Sidereals.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-10T20:14:22-07:00","id":1253199,"title":"","content":"Nah, don't see a demon blood* like that ending up as a 3rd circle. It would be weird for it to neatly fit into a soul hierarchy and all. An insanely potent demon blood would definitely fit, I might see fit to give it that part of the mara sorcerous initiation that lets a person draw sorcerous motes from shadows as just a thing that starts happening if it learns sorcerery. Like trying to teach it to connect with the world and draw on it for power in the spell just causes the thing to start drawing on the nearby shadows, possibly modified for whatever path it learns. Would be interesting to have it learn from an ifrit and end up sucking out the shadows from an area when it tries to draw on flames.<br /> <br /> <br /> *I'm gonna say demon-blood even though I don't think that's even close to the right term for such a thing,","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-10T21:21:42-07:00","id":1253208,"title":"","content":"What we've seen of offspring created by Primordials or even their highest souls tells me such a child would be a unique being that doesnt fit neatly into any category","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-10T22:27:54-07:00","id":1253217,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>vampire hunter D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1253101-say-the-scarlet-empress-had-a-child-with?p=1253208#post1253208\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What we've seen of offspring created by Primordials or even their highest souls tells me such a child would be a unique being that doesnt fit neatly into any category</div> </div> </div> </div>Or a human. Adorjan had kids too, later some uncoiled their mortal forms into Demon Winds.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}